@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title IOCP 송신, 완료 작업의 소유권과 취소
participant "핸들러" as H
participant "연결별 큐" as Q
participant "공용 송신 워커" as W
participant "Windows IOCP" as K
H -> Q : Enqueue(bytes)
note over Q : 256 KiB / 4096 frames, in-flight included
Q -> K : PostQueuedCompletionStatus
K -> W : Begin, batch <= 16 KiB target
note over Q,W : 연결마다 진행 중인 작업 하나
W -> K : WSASend(OVERLAPPED)
W -> W : GetQueuedCompletionStatus
note over W,K : 완료까지 버퍼와 연결 수명 유지
K --> W : completion(bytes, status)
alt partial
 W -> K : 부분 완료: 위치 이동 후 재요청
else full batch
 W -> K : 묶음 완료: 다음 묶음을 큐에 등록
else disconnect / overflow
 H -> Q : Stop()
 Q -> K : CancelIoEx, 완료까지 수명 유지
 K --> W : cancelled / completed
 W -> W : release operation owner
end
@enduml
